#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:1
msgid "Q-VAE for Single-Cell Transcriptomics"
msgstr "Q-VAE 单细胞转录组学"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:3
msgid ""
"This case study extends the [Q-VAE MNIST tutorial](qvae_mnist.md) to single-"
"cell RNA sequencing (scRNA-seq) data. It demonstrates how Q-VAE learns low-"
"dimensional representations of cell expression profiles, preserves cell-type"
" structure, and corrects batch effects. Building on the Q-ELBO framework, "
"this study adds clustering evaluation, UMAP visualization, and scIB "
"benchmark metrics."
msgstr ""
"本案例研究将 [Q-VAE MNIST 教程](qvae_mnist.md) 扩展到单细胞 RNA 测序（scRNA-seq）数据。它展示了 Q-VAE"
" 如何学习细胞表达谱的低维表示、保留细胞类型结构并校正批次效应。在 Q-ELBO 框架之上，本研究新增了聚类评估、UMAP 可视化和 scIB "
"基准指标。"

