#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:42
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:44
msgid ""
"A Q-VAE for single-cell data replaces the Gaussian prior with a QBM, "
"learning a low-dimensional representation that captures cell-type-specific "
"expression patterns:"
msgstr "用于单细胞数据的 Q-VAE 将高斯先验替换为 QBM，学习能够捕捉细胞类型特异性表达模式的低维表示："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:51
msgid "The key adaptations from MNIST:"
msgstr "相对于 MNIST 的关键调整："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:53
msgid ""
"**Input dimension**: scRNA-seq matrices are typically 10k–30k genes, "
"compared to 784 pixels in MNIST."
msgstr "**输入维度**：scRNA-seq 矩阵通常包含 10k–30k 个基因，而 MNIST 只有 784 个像素。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:54
msgid ""
"**Loss type**: MSE loss is used for continuous expression values (vs "
"Bernoulli for binary pixels)."
msgstr "**损失类型**：连续表达值使用 MSE 损失（而二值像素使用伯努利损失）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:55
msgid ""
"**Batch correction**: the Q-VAE representation learns to separate cell types"
" while removing batch effects."
msgstr "**批次校正**：Q-VAE 表示在消除批次效应的同时学会区分细胞类型。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:56
msgid ""
"**Evaluation**: clustering metrics (ARI, NMI) and scIB benchmarks measure "
"representation quality."
msgstr "**评估**：聚类指标（ARI、NMI）与 scIB 基准衡量表示质量。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:58
msgid ""
"The training objective remains the Q-ELBO: reconstruction loss + KL "
"divergence between encoder posterior and QBM prior. The sampler can be "
"switched between SA and CIM without changing the rest of the pipeline."
msgstr ""
"训练目标仍是 Q-ELBO：重建损失 + 编码器后验与 QBM 先验之间的 KL 散度。采样器可在 SA 与 CIM "
"之间切换，无需修改流水线的其余部分。"

