msgid "Evaluate clustering quality:"
msgstr "评估聚类质量："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:85
msgid "Key Code"
msgstr "关键代码"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:87
msgid "1. CellQVAE Model Architecture"
msgstr "1\\. CellQVAE 模型架构"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:89
msgid ""
"The `CellQVAE` model extends the base Q-VAE with a batch-conditioned decoder"
" for scRNA-seq data:"
msgstr "`CellQVAE` 模型在基础 Q-VAE 之上增加了批次条件化解码器，用于 scRNA-seq 数据："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:96
msgid "Key model details:"
msgstr "关键模型细节："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:97
msgid "Encoder: `QVAEEncoder` — maps scRNA-seq expression to latent space"
msgstr "编码器：`QVAEEncoder` — 将 scRNA-seq 表达映射到隐空间"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:98
msgid "Decoder: `QVAEDecoder` — reconstructs expression from latent samples"
msgstr "解码器：`QVAEDecoder` — 从隐样本重构表达"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:99
msgid "Batch conditioning: one-hot batch labels appended to decoder input"
msgstr "批次条件化：将 one-hot 批次标签拼接到解码器输入"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:100
msgid "QBM prior: trained with the same positive/negative phase as an RBM"
msgstr "QBM 先验：使用与 RBM 相同的正相/负相训练"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:104
msgid "2. Training Loop"
msgstr "2\\. 训练循环"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:106
msgid ""
"The `Trainer` class implements the Q-ELBO optimization loop for scRNA-seq "
"data:"
msgstr "`Trainer` 类实现了针对 scRNA-seq 数据的 Q-ELBO 优化循环："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:112
msgid "Key training details:"
msgstr "关键训练细节："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:113
msgid "Optimizer: Adam with learning rate scheduling"
msgstr "优化器：Adam，带学习率调度"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:114
msgid "Reconstruction loss: MSE (continuous expression values)"
msgstr "重建损失：MSE（连续表达值）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:115
msgid "KL term: pulls encoder posterior toward QBM prior"
msgstr "KL 项：将编码器后验拉向 QBM 先验"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:116
msgid "Sampler: switch between SA and CIM via `--sampler-type`"
msgstr "采样器：通过 `--sampler-type` 在 SA 与 CIM 之间切换"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:120
msgid "3. Evaluation Benchmark"
msgstr "3\\. 评估基准"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:122
msgid ""
"The `evaluate_benchmark.py` provides unified evaluation for clustering, "
"classification, and scIB metrics:"
msgstr "`evaluate_benchmark.py` 为聚类、分类与 scIB 指标提供统一评估："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:129
msgid "Training and Evaluation"
msgstr "训练 和 评估"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:131
msgid ""
"**Training curves**: `plot_training_history` tracks reconstruction loss and "
"KL divergence over epochs."
msgstr "**训练曲线**：`plot_training_history` 跟踪各 epoch 的重建损失与 KL 散度。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:132
msgid ""
"**UMAP visualization**: `save_umap_plots` reduces the 256-dim latent "
"representation to 2-D, colored by cell type."
msgstr "**UMAP 可视化**：`save_umap_plots` 将 256 维隐表示降维到二维，按细胞类型着色。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:133
msgid ""
"**Energy distribution**: `save_energy_plots` shows how QBM energy varies "
"across cell types."
msgstr "**能量分布**：`save_energy_plots` 展示 QBM 能量在不同细胞类型间的变化。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:134
msgid ""
"**Clustering metrics**: ARI, AMI, NMI, Homogeneity, FMI measure clustering "
"quality."
msgstr "**聚类指标**：ARI、AMI、NMI、同质性（Homogeneity）、FMI 衡量聚类质量。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:135
msgid ""
"**scIB benchmarks**: biological conservation and batch-correction metrics."
msgstr "**scIB 基准**：生物信息保持与批次校正指标。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:137
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "总结"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:139
msgid ""
"Q-VAE scales from MNIST to high-dimensional scRNA-seq data with minimal "
"changes."
msgstr "Q-VAE 能以极少的改动从 MNIST 扩展到高维 scRNA-seq 数据。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:140
msgid ""
"The Q-ELBO framework remains the same; only the loss type and input "
"dimension change."
msgstr "Q-ELBO 框架保持不变；仅损失类型与输入维度发生变化。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:141
msgid ""
"Learned representations preserve cell-type structure and correct batch "
"effects."
msgstr "学习到的表示保留了细胞类型结构并校正了批次效应。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:142
msgid ""
"The sampler (SA vs CIM) can be switched without changing the rest of the "
"pipeline."
msgstr "采样器（SA 与 CIM）可切换，无需修改流水线其余部分。"

